      "fragment_index": 2,
      "start": 55.8,
      "end": 108.3,
      "duration": 52.5,
      "text": "We are standing at a pivotal moment and our discussion today is about ensuring our young people are equipped, not just to survive this AI-driven future, but to shape it. Many thanks to the conveners of the conference who are UNESCO, and thank you for giving us this incredible platform, that is AI for IA. Also, I want to thank UNESCO Rosa for inviting me as a panelist on the conference. It's a privilege to be here among many distinguished scholars to discuss a topic so close to my heart. Firstly, I'd like to talk about the risks and opportunities in terms of how AI affects the youth, employment and creativity. Let's address the elephant in the room first.",
