      "fragment_index": 4,
      "start": 166.52,
      "end": 231.86,
      "duration": 65.34,
      "text": "When we talk of employment, AI is a powerful tool for job creation and augmentation. It is not going to replace the marketer, but a marketer will use AI for data analysis and customer insight generation will replace the one who doesn't. The future of employment is human to AI collaboration. For our youth, this means the most valuable skills will be critical thinking, prompt engineering, emotional intelligence and complex problem solving skills. That skills that AI cannot replicate. And then when we talk of creativity, this is the most exciting part. AI should be viewed as the ultimate collaborator and amplifier. Imagine a young filmmaker in Buluere using AI to storyboard scenes and generate concept art, freeing up the budget for local actors and the crew.",
