      "text": "Young people who are excited by AI's potential, but are also equipped and empowered to guard against its perils. Building a future that is not only smart, but also just and uniting African. In conclusion, the relationship between AI and the youth isn't a passive one. It's a dynamic dance. Yes, there are risks to employment and creativity that we must mitigate through education and policy, but the overwhelming narrative must be one of opportunity and agency. By empowering our youth with the right skills, ethical frameworks and platforms for innovation, we can ensure they are the architects of Zimbabwe's AI-powered future. Not just its subjects, thank you.",
